        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2011 Society of Cardiovascular Computed Tomography. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "A patient with crescendo angina underwent CTA, CTMPI and invasive angiography. Abnormal flow reserve was demonstrated in the RCA territory, which corresponded to a significant lesion demonstrated on CTA and invasive angiography. The defect was demonstrated prior to PCI, and resolved post PCI."
